Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Daniel Caraminot?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Pensioner: Daniel Caraminot's Journey"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 59, "end": 166, "text": "In the picturesque French countryside, a peculiar sight could be seen in the small village of Saint-Pierre."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 167, "end": 294, "text": "Amidst the rolling hills and vineyards, a former French politician, Daniel Caraminot, was living a life that defied convention."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 295, "end": 443, "text": "While his peers were still immersed in the cutthroat world of politics, Daniel had chosen a different path – one that led him to become a pensioner."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 444, "end": 488, "text": "At first glance, it seemed like an oxymoron."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 489, "end": 627, "text": "How could a man who had spent his life in the corridors of power, shaping the destiny of France, now be content with collecting a pension?"}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 628, "end": 738, "text": "The answer lay in Daniel's remarkable journey, one that was marked by a series of unexpected twists and turns."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 739, "end": 805, "text": "As a young man, Daniel was driven by a passion for public service."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 806, "end": 920, "text": "He entered politics with a fire in his belly, determined to make a difference in the lives of his fellow citizens."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 921, "end": 1018, "text": "Over the years, he rose through the ranks, earning a reputation as a shrewd and effective leader."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1019, "end": 1136, "text": "His dedication and charisma earned him the respect of his peers, and he became a prominent figure in French politics."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1137, "end": 1224, "text": "However, as the years went by, Daniel began to feel the weight of his responsibilities."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1225, "end": 1325, "text": "The constant pressure to perform, the endless meetings, and the scrutiny of the media took its toll."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1326, "end": 1401, "text": "He started to feel like a cog in a machine, rather than a force for change."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1402, "end": 1504, "text": "The final straw came when he was forced to make a difficult decision that went against his conscience."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1505, "end": 1565, "text": "The experience left him feeling disillusioned and burnt out."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1566, "end": 1640, "text": "It was then that Daniel made the bold decision to step away from politics."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1641, "end": 1719, "text": "He realized that he had been living someone else's dream, rather than his own."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1720, "end": 1871, "text": "The thought of collecting a pension, once seen as a symbol of laziness, now represented freedom – the freedom to pursue his own passions and interests."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1872, "end": 1968, "text": "As Daniel settled into his new life, he discovered a sense of purpose he had never known before."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1969, "end": 2061, "text": "He spent his days tending to his garden, reading books, and volunteering at a local charity."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2062, "end": 2217, "text": "The pension he received was no longer a symbol of retirement, but a badge of honor – a reminder that he had earned the right to live life on his own terms."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2218, "end": 2311, "text": "The villagers, who had once seen Daniel as a distant figure, now saw him as one of their own."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2312, "end": 2396, "text": "They would often stop by his cottage, seeking advice or simply enjoying his company."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 20, "text": "**Daniel Caraminot**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 22, "end": 138, "text": "Daniel Caraminot is a French politician who has made significant contributions to the agricultural sector in France."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 139, "end": 289, "text": "Born on May 12, 1965, in Lyon, France, Caraminot has dedicated his career to advocating for the rights and interests of farmers and rural communities."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 290, "end": 318, "text": "**Early Life and Education**"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 320, "end": 445, "text": "Caraminot grew up in a family of farmers and was exposed to the challenges and rewards of agricultural work from a young age."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 446, "end": 570, "text": "He pursued higher education in agricultural science at the University of Lyon, where he earned a degree in agronomy in 1988."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 571, "end": 581, "text": "**Career**"}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 583, "end": 759, "text": "After completing his studies, Caraminot worked as an agricultural consultant for several years, providing guidance to farmers on best practices and sustainable farming methods."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 760, "end": 869, "text": "In 1995, he was elected to the French National Assembly as a representative of the rural constituency of Ain."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 870, "end": 1036, "text": "During his tenure, he served on the Committee on Agriculture and Rural Development, where he championed policies supporting small-scale farmers and rural development."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1037, "end": 1086, "text": "**Advocacy for Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants**"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1088, "end": 1299, "text": "Caraminot's work as an advocate for ancients agriculteurs exploitants (former farmer-operators) has been instrumental in raising awareness about the challenges faced by this socioprofessional category in France."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1300, "end": 1635, "text": "In 2002, he co-authored a study titled \"The Plight of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants: A Study on the Socio-Economic Challenges Facing Former Farmer-Operators in France\" (French: \"La situation des anciens agriculteurs exploitants: une étude sur les défis socio-économiques rencontrés par les anciens exploitants agricoles en France\")."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1636, "end": 1771, "text": "The study highlighted the difficulties faced by former farmer-operators in accessing social services, healthcare, and pension benefits."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1772, "end": 1796, "text": "**Notable Achievements**"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1798, "end": 2062, "text": "In 2005, Caraminot was appointed as the President of the French Association of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants (Association française des anciens agriculteurs exploitants), a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting the interests of former farmer-operators."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2063, "end": 2352, "text": "Under his leadership, the organization successfully lobbied for the passage of the \"Law on the Protection of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants\" (Loi sur la protection des anciens agriculteurs exploitants) in 2008, which provided additional support and resources for former farmer-operators."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Daniel Caraminot", "scope": "past occupation", "claim": "Daniel Caraminot was a former French politician.", "answer": "former French politician", "quote": "Amidst the rolling hills and vineyards, a former French politician, Daniel Caraminot, was living a life that defied convention.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Daniel Caraminot", "scope": "Occupation", "claim": "Daniel Caraminot is a French politician who has made significant contributions to the agricultural sector in France.", "answer": "French politician", "quote": "Daniel Caraminot is a French politician who has made significant contributions to the agricultural sector in France.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["French politician", "former French politician", "agricultural consultant", "President of the French Association of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants", "advocate for ancients agriculteurs exploitants", "representative of the rural constituency of Ain", "pensioner"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "French politician", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "former French politician", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "agricultural consultant", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "President of the French Association of Anciens Agriculteurs Exploitants", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R4", "answer": "advocate for ancients agriculteurs exploitants", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R5", "answer": "representative of the rural constituency of Ain", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R6", "answer": "pensioner", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}

